{%- comment -%}
  ═══ LBASS — HOMEPAGE HERO CAROUSEL (2026-09-26) ═══

  Replaces the old JS hero swap. The clothing hero is now SERVER-RENDERED here,
  byte-for-byte the markup snippets/lbass-hero-swap.liquid used to inject at
  DOMContentLoaded (plus an id on the H1 and click tracking on its two CTAs).
  Measured on the live homepage before this change (desktop 1440×900):
    · CLS 0.16 — the old <section class="hero"> painted, then got swapped out
    · the old hero's 1.8 MB film and the 600 KB three.js were downloaded for
      nothing, and its particle script threw «Cannot read properties of null»
  Rendering the final hero in the HTML removes all three. lbass-hero-swap now
  finds .lbh and does nothing (its guard), but still supplies the .lbh CSS,
  the hero-type / hero-mobile / hero-cta styles and hero-fx (word reveal +
  particles), which initialise on DOMContentLoaded as before. (It also preloaded
  the old background image until 2026-10-01.)

  SLIDES (the existing designs are the source of truth — nothing redesigned):
    0  LBASS ORIGINAL · Pre-Loved Clothing     the clothing hero. Since 2026-10-01 its
                                               background is a wall of real in-stock
                                               photos and its CTA group ends with one
                                               real piece (snippets/lbass-hero-proof,
                                               fed by hero_pick from index.liquid)
    1  ARABIC FRAGRANCES · Discover Your Signature Scent
                                               snippets/lbass-frag-hero.liquid
    +1 K-BEAUTY · Korean Skincare               snippets/lbass-beauty-hero.liquid
                                               (2026-09-26 night; shown once /collections/cosmetics
                                               has products, or on an unpublished preview theme)
    2+ any ACTIVE entry of the metaobject «Hero slide (homepage carousel)»
       (Shopify admin → Content → Metaobjects), ordered by Position, shown only
       between «Show from» and «Show until». Cosmetics, accessories, campaigns:
       no code needed.

  BEHAVIOUR: horizontal slide (RTL-aware, 0.5 s move since 2026-09-28 — owner
  chose to keep 5 s over 3 s so each slide stays readable), 5 s autoplay (owner request
  2026-09-26: no visible timer bar, and it must KEEP SLIDING while the mouse is
  over the hero and after a click — a click just restarts the 5 s from the
  chosen slide). It pauses only while keyboard focus is inside the carousel,
  while a finger is dragging it, while it is scrolled out of view, or while the
  browser tab is hidden. Category tabs (static underline on the active one),
  arrows (≥768 px), dots, swipe that follows the finger, ← → Home End keys.
  prefers-reduced-motion: no autoplay, no slide animation. /#fragrances opens
  on the fragrance slide and stays there.
  Slides after the first load their images after window.load (or on first
  visit), so only the clothing hero's images load with the page. All slides share the
  tallest height, so nothing below the carousel moves.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign hc_frag = collections['fragrances']
  assign hc_frag_n = hc_frag.products_count | default: 0 | plus: 0
  assign hc_show_frag = false
  if hc_frag_n > 0 or theme.role == 'unpublished'
    assign hc_show_frag = true
  endif
  assign hc_bt = collections['cosmetics']
  assign hc_bt_n = hc_bt.products_count | default: 0 | plus: 0
  assign hc_show_beauty = false
  if hc_bt_n > 0 or theme.role == 'unpublished'
    assign hc_show_beauty = true
  endif
  # 2026-09-30, strategic assessment approved by the owner: clothing-first homepage.
  # The hero shows only the clothing slide (plus any active «Hero slide» metaobject
  # campaign). Fragrance is one row lower on the page (snippets/lbass-home-fragrances,
  # best sellers only); K-beauty stays in the menu only. Delete these two lines to revert.
  assign hc_show_frag = false
  assign hc_show_beauty = false
  assign hc_bi = 1
  if hc_show_frag
    assign hc_bi = 2
  endif

  assign hc_now = 'now' | date: '%s' | plus: 0
  assign hc_keys = ''
  for s in shop.metaobjects.lbass_hero_slide.values
    assign hc_ok = true
    if s.heading == blank or s.tab_label == blank
      assign hc_ok = false
    endif
    if s.starts_at.value != blank
      assign hc_st = s.starts_at.value | date: '%s' | plus: 0
      if hc_st > hc_now
        assign hc_ok = false
      endif
    endif
    if s.ends_at.value != blank
      assign hc_en = s.ends_at.value | date: '%s' | plus: 0
      if hc_en < hc_now
        assign hc_ok = false
      endif
    endif
    if hc_ok
      assign hc_pos = s.position.value | default: 50 | plus: 1000
      assign hc_keys = hc_keys | append: hc_pos | append: '|' | append: s.system.handle | append: ','
    endif
  endfor
  assign hc_keys = hc_keys | split: ',' | sort

  assign hc_total = 1
  if hc_show_frag
    assign hc_total = hc_total | plus: 1
  endif
  if hc_show_beauty
    assign hc_total = hc_total | plus: 1
  endif
  assign hc_total = hc_total | plus: hc_keys.size
-%}
<style>
.lbhs{position:relative;width:100%}
.lbhs-tabs{display:flex;background:#FFFFFF;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(11,11,12,.12);transition:background-color .6s ease,border-color .6s ease}
.lbhs-tab{-webkit-appearance:none;appearance:none;position:relative;flex:1 1 0;min-width:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:2px;
  min-height:52px;margin:0;padding:8px 12px 10px;border:0;border-radius:0;background:transparent;cursor:pointer;color:#6B6B6E;
  transition:color .25s,background-color .25s}
.lbhs-tab b{font-family:var(--lb-latin,'Epilogue',system-ui,sans-serif);font-size:11px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.24em;text-transform:uppercase;line-height:1.3;direction:ltr;white-space:nowrap}
.lbhs-tab small{font-family:var(--lb-latin,'Epilogue',system-ui,sans-serif);font-size:11.5px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:.02em;line-height:1.3;direction:ltr;opacity:.85;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;max-width:100%}
.lbhs-tab + .lbhs-tab{border-inline-start:1px solid rgba(11,11,12,.12)}
.lbhs-tab:hover{color:#0B0B0C}
.lbhs-tab[aria-selected="true"]{color:#0B0B0C;background:#FAF7F2}
.lbhs-tab:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #BF2E15;outline-offset:-3px}
.lbhs-bar{position:absolute;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;height:2px;overflow:hidden}
.lbhs-bar i{position:absolute;inset:0;background:#BF2E15;transform:scaleX(0);transform-origin:50% 50%;transition:transform .35s ease}
.lbhs-tab[aria-selected="true"] .lbhs-bar i{transform:scaleX(1)}
.lbhs[data-lbhs-tone="dark"] .lbhs-tabs{background:#120E0A;border-bottom-color:rgba(214,164,86,.22)}
.lbhs[data-lbhs-tone="dark"] .lbhs-tab{color:rgba(244,237,225,.58)}
.lbhs[data-lbhs-tone="dark"] .lbhs-tab:hover{color:#F4EDE1}
.lbhs[data-lbhs-tone="dark"] .lbhs-tab + .lbhs-tab{border-inline-start-color:rgba(214,164,86,.18)}
.lbhs[data-lbhs-tone="dark"] .lbhs-tab[aria-selected="true"]{color:#F2D398;background:#1B140E}
.lbhs[data-lbhs-tone="dark"] .lbhs-bar i{background:#C8913E}

.lbhs-viewport{position:relative;overflow:hidden;touch-action:pan-y}
.lbhs-track{display:flex;transform:translate3d(0,0,0);transition:transform .5s cubic-bezier(.22,.61,.36,1);will-change:transform}
.lbhs-track.is-drag{transition:none}
.lbhs-slide{position:relative;flex:0 0 100%;min-width:0;display:flex}
.lbhs-slide > *{flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;width:100%}
.lbhs .lbh-cue{display:none}

.lbhs-arrow{position:absolute;top:50%;z-index:6;width:48px;height:48px;margin-top:-24px;display:grid;place-items:center;padding:0;
  border-radius:50%;border:1px solid rgba(11,11,12,.16);background:rgba(255,255,255,.78);color:#0B0B0C;cursor:pointer;
  -webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(8px);backdrop-filter:blur(8px);box-shadow:0 8px 22px rgba(11,11,12,.12);
  transition:background-color .2s,color .2s,border-color .2s,transform .2s,opacity .2s;opacity:.9}
.lbhs-arrow:hover{opacity:1;transform:scale(1.06)}
.lbhs-arrow:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #BF2E15;outline-offset:3px}
.lbhs-prev{inset-inline-start:18px}
.lbhs-next{inset-inline-end:18px}
.lbhs-arrow svg{width:18px;height:18px}
[dir="rtl"] .lbhs-arrow svg{transform:scaleX(-1)}
.lbhs[data-lbhs-tone="dark"] .lbhs-arrow{background:rgba(20,14,9,.55);border-color:rgba(214,164,86,.38);color:#F2D398;box-shadow:none}
.lbhs-dots{position:absolute;left:50%;bottom:16px;z-index:6;transform:translateX(-50%);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;
  padding:7px 10px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.72);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(6px);backdrop-filter:blur(6px)}
.lbhs-dot{width:8px;height:8px;padding:0;border:0;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(11,11,12,.28);cursor:pointer;transition:width .3s ease,background-color .3s ease}
.lbhs-dot[aria-current="true"]{width:22px;background:#BF2E15}
.lbhs-dot:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #BF2E15;outline-offset:2px}
.lbhs[data-lbhs-tone="dark"] .lbhs-dots{background:rgba(20,14,9,.5)}
.lbhs[data-lbhs-tone="dark"] .lbhs-dot{background:rgba(244,237,225,.35)}
.lbhs[data-lbhs-tone="dark"] .lbhs-dot[aria-current="true"]{background:#D6A456}

/* extra slides (metaobjects) */
.lbcs{position:relative;display:flex;align-items:center;min-height:82svh;overflow:hidden;isolation:isolate;background:#0E0B08;color:#F4EDE1;
  font-family:var(--lb-arabic,'Alexandria','Tajawal',system-ui,sans-serif)}
.lbcs-media{position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:-2}
.lbcs-media img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block}
.lbcs::after{content:'';position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:-1;background:linear-gradient(270deg,rgba(10,8,6,.78) 0%,rgba(10,8,6,.45) 45%,rgba(10,8,6,.05) 80%)}
.lbcs--light{color:#0B0B0C;background:#F4F2ED}
.lbcs--light::after{background:linear-gradient(270deg,rgba(255,255,255,.86) 0%,rgba(255,255,255,.5) 45%,rgba(255,255,255,0) 80%)}
.lbcs-in{width:100%;max-width:1320px;margin:0 auto;padding:clamp(44px,6vw,92px) clamp(20px,4vw,52px)}
.lbcs-in > *{max-width:560px}
.lbcs-eyebrow{margin:0 0 14px;font-family:var(--lb-latin,'Epilogue',system-ui,sans-serif);font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.36em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#D6A456}
.lbcs--light .lbcs-eyebrow{color:#BF2E15}
.lbcs-h{margin:0;font-weight:900;font-size:clamp(30px,4.4vw,64px);line-height:1.18}
.lbcs-t{margin:18px 0 0;font-size:clamp(14px,1.2vw,17px);line-height:1.9;opacity:.85}
.lbcs-btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-height:54px;margin-top:26px;padding:0 30px;font-weight:900;font-size:15px;text-decoration:none;
  background:#F4EDE1;color:#0B0B0C}
.lbcs--light .lbcs-btn{background:#0B0B0C;color:#F4EDE1}

@media(max-width:767px){
  /* phones: slides take the height of their content (~594 px) instead of 76svh
     (641 px on a 390×844 phone), so the category strip starts on the first screen */
  .lbhs .lbh{min-height:0!important}
  .lbhs .lbfh--slide{min-height:0}
  .lbhs .lbbh--slide{min-height:0}
  .lbhs-tab{min-height:50px;padding:7px 8px 9px}
  .lbhs-tab b{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.16em}
  .lbhs-tab small{font-size:10.5px}
  .lbhs-arrow{display:none}
  .lbhs-dots{bottom:10px;padding:6px 9px}
  .lbcs{min-height:76svh;align-items:flex-end}
  .lbcs::after{background:linear-gradient(0deg,rgba(10,8,6,.85) 0%,rgba(10,8,6,.4) 55%,rgba(10,8,6,0) 85%)}
  .lbcs--light::after{background:linear-gradient(0deg,rgba(255,255,255,.9) 0%,rgba(255,255,255,.5) 55%,rgba(255,255,255,0) 85%)}
  .lbcs-in{padding:30px 20px 48px}
}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){ .lbhs-track{transition:none} .lbhs-dot,.lbhs-tab,.lbhs-arrow,.lbhs-bar i{transition:none} }
</style>

<div class="lbhs{% if hc_total < 2 %} lbhs--single{% endif %}" id="lbhs" data-lbhs data-lbhs-cur="0" data-lbhs-tone="light"{% if hc_total > 1 %} role="region" aria-roledescription="carousel" aria-label="Lbass Original"{% endif %}>
  {%- if hc_total > 1 -%}
  <div class="lbhs-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="اختار القسم · Choose a category">
    <button type="button" class="lbhs-tab" role="tab" id="lbhsTab0" aria-controls="lbhsSlide0" aria-selected="true" data-lbhs-go="0" data-cro-event="hero_slide_tab" data-cro-label="clothing"><b>LBASS ORIGINAL</b><small>Pre-Loved Clothing</small><span class="lbhs-bar" aria-hidden="true"><i></i></span></button>
    {%- if hc_show_frag -%}
    <button type="button" class="lbhs-tab" role="tab" id="lbhsTab1" aria-controls="lbhsSlide1" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" data-lbhs-go="1" data-cro-event="hero_slide_tab" data-cro-label="fragrances"><b>ARABIC FRAGRANCES</b><small>Discover Your Signature Scent</small><span class="lbhs-bar" aria-hidden="true"><i></i></span></button>
